#: data/io.github.yuanliou.FlatpakAppInstaller.desktop.in
msgid "App Installer"
msgstr "App 安裝程式"

#: data/io.github.yuanliou.FlatpakAppInstaller.desktop.in
#: data/io.github.yuanliou.FlatpakAppInstaller.metainfo.xml.in src/main.cpp
#: src/qml/Main.qml
#, kde-format
msgid "Flatpak App Installer"
msgstr "Flatpak App 安裝程式"

#: data/io.github.yuanliou.FlatpakAppInstaller.desktop.in src/main.cpp
#, kde-format
msgid "Install apps you downloaded from the internet"
msgstr "安裝你從網路下載的 App"

#: data/io.github.yuanliou.FlatpakAppInstaller.desktop.in
msgid "flatpak;flathub;install;app;software;"
msgstr "flatpak;flathub;install;app;software;安裝;應用程式;軟體;"

#: data/io.github.yuanliou.FlatpakAppInstaller.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "Install downloaded apps by dragging them"
msgstr "用拖曳的方式安裝下載的 App"

#: data/io.github.yuanliou.FlatpakAppInstaller.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Downloaded an app that ends in “.flatpak” or “.flatpakref”? Double-click it "
"and drag the app to where you want to install it, just like on a Mac."
msgstr ""
"下載了檔名結尾是「.flatpak」或「.flatpakref」的 App 嗎？在檔案上按兩下，再把 "
"App 拖到你想安裝的位置就好，跟在 Mac 上安裝一樣簡單。"

#: data/io.github.yuanliou.FlatpakAppInstaller.metainfo.xml.in
msgid ""
"Choose “Just for me” to install it only for yourself, or “Everyone on this "
"computer” so that everybody who uses the computer can open it."
msgstr ""
"選「只給我用」就只有你能使用；選「給這台電腦的所有人」，每個使用這台電腦的人"
"都能開啟。"

#: data/io.github.yuanliou.FlatpakAppInstaller.metainfo.xml.in
msgid "First development version."
msgstr "第一個開發版本。"

#: src/installer.cpp
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This computer can't install Flatpak apps yet, because the Flatpak software "
"isn't installed."
msgstr "這台電腦還沒有安裝 Flatpak，所以暫時沒辦法安裝 Flatpak App。"

#: src/installer.cpp
#, kde-format
msgid "This file can't be opened. It may have been moved or deleted."
msgstr "這個檔案打不開，可能已經被移動或刪除了。"

#: src/installer.cpp
#, kde-format
msgid ""
"This file isn't an app that can be installed here. Look for a download that "
"ends in “.flatpak” or “.flatpakref”."
msgstr ""
"這個檔案不是可以在這裡安裝的 App。請找檔名結尾是「.flatpak」或「.flatpakref」"
"的下載檔案。"

#: src/installer.cpp
#, kde-format
msgid "“%1” couldn't be installed."
msgstr "「%1」沒有安裝成功。"

#: src/main.cpp
#, kde-format
msgid "The .flatpak or .flatpakref file to install"
msgstr "要安裝的 .flatpak 或 .flatpakref 檔案"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid ""
"Ask the person who manages this computer to install Flatpak, or see "
"flatpak.org/setup for instructions."
msgstr ""
"請管理這台電腦的人幫忙安裝 Flatpak，或到 flatpak.org/setup 查看安裝說明。"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "By %1"
msgstr "開發者：%1"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "Choose Another File…"
msgstr "選擇其他檔案…"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "Choose File…"
msgstr "選擇檔案…"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "Close"
msgstr "關閉"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "Done"
msgstr "完成"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid ""
"Double-click an app you downloaded (a file ending in “.flatpak” or "
"“.flatpakref”), or choose one here."
msgstr ""
"在下載好的 App 檔案（檔名結尾是「.flatpak」或「.flatpakref」）上按兩下，或是"
"在這裡選擇檔案。"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "Drag the app onto where you want to install it."
msgstr "把 App 拖到你想安裝的位置。"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "Everyone on this computer"
msgstr "給這台電腦的所有人"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "Everyone on this computer can now find it in the app menu."
msgstr "這台電腦的所有人現在都可以在應用程式選單裡找到它。"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid ""
"Everyone who uses this computer can open it. You may need to enter your "
"password."
msgstr "每個使用這台電腦的人都能開啟，可能需要輸入你的密碼。"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgctxt "File dialog filter; keep the parentheses and the patterns unchanged"
msgid "Flatpak apps (*.flatpak *.flatpakref)"
msgstr "Flatpak App (*.flatpak *.flatpakref)"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "Getting ready…"
msgstr "準備中…"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "Hide Details"
msgstr "隱藏詳細資訊"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "Install an app"
msgstr "安裝 App"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "Install “%1”"
msgstr "安裝「%1」"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "Installing “%1”…"
msgstr "正在安裝「%1」…"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "Just for me"
msgstr "只給我用"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "Needs %1 of space"
msgstr "需要 %1 的空間"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "Only you can use it. No password needed."
msgstr "只有你能使用，不需要輸入密碼。"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "Open “%1”"
msgstr "開啟「%1」"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "Please check your internet connection and try again."
msgstr "請檢查網路連線，然後再試一次。"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "Please wait until the installation is finished."
msgstr "請等安裝完成後再關閉。"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "Show Details"
msgstr "顯示詳細資訊"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "This may take a few minutes. Please keep this window open."
msgstr "可能需要幾分鐘，請不要關閉這個視窗。"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "Try Again"
msgstr "再試一次"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "Version %1"
msgstr "版本 %1"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "You can now find it in your app menu."
msgstr "現在可以在應用程式選單裡找到它了。"

#: src/qml/Main.qml
msgid "“%1” is installed"
msgstr "「%1」安裝好了"
